ièrement féroce est réanimé et transformé par les laboratoires de l'armée en véritable cyborg.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/FR_DEQY451056A_1893773195_0_20260531T061411587Z_122_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-66fc4d58c8-ptkl9.jpeg","r":"12","src":"samsung","n":1,"ir":1.78},{"s":1795234618000,"e":1795239573000,"t":"Land Shark","d":"Qian Cheng a installé un laboratoire de recherche biopharmaceutique au cœur de la jungle. Lorsque les chercheurs modifient l'ADN d'un requin pour développer un nouveau remède contre le cancer, ils créent involontairement un monstre.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/FR_DEQY451056A_1262685056_1_20251017T073436525Z_122_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-5db7c6bc99-d5mt6.jpeg","r":"12","src":"samsung","n":1,"ir":1.78},{"s":1795239573000,"e":1795245408000,"t":"The Box","d":"Adam reçoit de la part d'un proche une mystérieuse boite contenant un terrible secret.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/FR_DEQY451056A_2346134107_0_20261104T060616659Z_114_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-b5879c6c6-r8qlx.jpeg","r":"12","src":"samsung","n":1,"ir":1.78},{"s":1795245408000,"e":1795250762000,"t":"Ape vs Mecha Ape","d":"L'armée fabrique sa propre I.A. prête au combat : Mecha Ape.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/FR_DEQY451056A_1819110746_0_20260502T044552857Z_39_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-74d4c47476-6jqtv.jpeg","r":"12","src":"samsung","n":1,"ir":1.78},{"s":1795250762000,"e":1795256463000,"t":"The Flood","d":"Pendant un ouragan, un commissariat de Louisiane abritant des détenus se retrouve submergé… et envahi par des alligators géants. Prisonniers et policiers doivent s'unir pour survivre.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/FR_DEQY451056A_1266566484_0_20251019T041751669Z_22_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-5db7c6bc99-x889l.jpeg","r":"12","src":"samsung","n":1,"ir":1.78},{"s":1795256463000,"e":1795261557000,"t":"LE KRAKEN DU PACIFIQUE","d":"Un marin et sa fiancée affrontent un monstre marin colossal et des pirates en haute mer.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/FR_DEQY451056A_2150056424_0_20260830T074309980Z_3_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-b5879c6c6-d8qch.jpeg","r":"12","src":"samsung","n":1,"ir":1.78},{"s":1795261557000,"e":1795267215000,"t":"Alien Predator","d":"Une équipe d'opérations secrètes est envoyée pour enquêter sur le crash d'un objet non identifié.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/FR_DEQY451056A_2097634874_0_20260812T044153927Z_75_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-648598f6b5-j5xsn.jpeg","r":"12","src":"samsung","n":1,"ir":1.78},{"s":1795267215000,"e":1795272849000,"t":"Ice Sharks","d":"Une nouvelle race de requins particulièrement agressifs sort de son sommeil après le dégel d'une partie profonde de l'océan.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/FR_DEQY451056A_1262685069_1_20251017T073434428Z_61_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-5db7c6bc99-d5mt6.jpeg","r":"12","src":"samsung","n":1,"ir":1.78},{"s":1795272849000,"e":1795279406000,"t":"Mutant Legacy","d":"Un groupe de mutants parias est traqué par un organisme gouvernemental.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/FR_DEQY451056A_2333995806_0_20261031T060927521Z_3_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-b5879c6c6-669wl.jpeg","r":"12","src":"samsung","n":1,"ir":1.78}]}